# bare-metal search: benchmark data + run artifacts are deliverables, never noise
# (.search/ worktrees carry their own in-tree negations; git cannot re-include
#  under an excluded parent dir, so only root roles are negated here)
!bench/**/*.json
!runs/*.json
*.csv
*.parquet
/.data/

